    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Less tired</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>Morning cough easing since he stopped smoking</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Mild nausea after the morning varenicline dose</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No headaches</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Positive</td><td>Mood better; vivid dreams; PHQ-9 11; no suicidal ideation</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>5 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

